WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.860
- Can you tell everybody
(audience claps)

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:02.337
about your new show though?

00:00:02.337 --> 00:00:04.160
"The Big Shot with Bethany"?

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:08.020
- So "The Big Shot with
Bethany" is a modern version

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:11.220
of "The Apprentice" where
it's about real business,

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.220
real brands.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.050
It's about me as a person,

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:15.750
meaning you're seeing me warts and all

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:18.120
and how I'm holding this business together

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.700
often with Scotch tape.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.360
It comes from a genuine need

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:23.430
where I need my second in command.

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:25.110
And it's a very different show.

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.660
It's very unexpected.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:28.650
It's showing the truth of my business,

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:30.870
that it's hard, that I hold it together,

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:33.450
that I work like an animal,

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:36.870
and that I need somebody to be my second

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.820
to take off some of the pressure.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.450
And it's all totally real.

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:42.800
And it's based on my businesses

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:46.510
versus just manufactured
projects and tasks, integrations.

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:48.420
It's not, it's actually
things that are happening

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:50.680
in the world within my business.

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:52.410
- You are so impressive.

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:53.420
Thank you so much.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:54.840
It's so nice to have you on the show

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.270
but also just to meet you.

00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:57.620
- Oh, so nice to meet you too.

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:58.690
Thank you so much.

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:00.120
So funny, at the
beginning of the pandemic,

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.530
my daughter and I was singing "Stronger".

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:02.710
Like that was sort of an anthem,

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:03.930
we were playing it
- Yes!

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:04.763
- and just singing it,
(audience claps)

00:01:04.763 --> 00:01:06.370
so right before you came on,
- Yes.

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:08.890
- I said to (indistinct) want
you to meet Kelly Clarkson,

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:11.440
and I said, "She's the one who,
you know, sings 'Stronger'."

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:12.560
She's like, "Oh", cause you know,

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:13.508
she's always on Tik Tok,
- Oh.

00:01:13.508 --> 00:01:14.758
- so now's she impressed.

